# Loki Laufeyson: the delayed ability is no ability of Loki (CR 603.7), so it is set up and goes on waiting though Loki is
# gone, and "Loki's power" is then the power it last had on the battlefield (CR 608.2h). Bot1 powers Loki up to a 4/3 and
# activates it; Bot2 Bolts Loki in response. Then Bot1 casts Mine Collapse by sacrificing a Mountain, mana value 4: no more
# than the 4 Loki last had (the card in the graveyard is a 2/1), so it is copied, and both of Bot2's creatures die.

